# The deposited archive is fetched from the Yale Dataverse by download_original.R,
# not redistributed.
original/

# trump.rds is the deposited respondent-level file serialised, with nothing
# recoded, added or dropped. Committing it would redistribute the deposit through
# the back door, so it is rebuilt from original/ by maintained/clean_trump.R.
maintained/output/trump.rds

# Working log stays private, per the house rule for public repos.
notes.md

